@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Read saved calculation details (no price refresh or database writes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/calculations/24050/aggregate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Missing calculation returns 404 when authenticated
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/calculations/2147483647/aggregate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Search calculations (authentication via bearer token or existing access_token cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calculations/search
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": { "conditions": [] },
  "pagination": { "pageNumber": 1, "pageSize": 25 },
  "orderBy": [{ "field": "id", "direction": "desc" }]
}

### Combine all five filters using the visible supplier order number
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calculations/search
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "conditions": [
      { "field": "productname", "operator": "contains", "value": "kartong" },
      { "field": "suppliername", "operator": "contains", "value": "Bart" },
      { "field": "customername", "operator": "contains", "value": "Plasto" },
      { "field": "id", "operator": "eq", "value": 24050 },
      { "field": "supplierordernr", "operator": "contains", "value": "44654" }
    ]
  },
  "pagination": { "pageNumber": 1, "pageSize": 25 },
  "orderBy": [{ "field": "productname", "direction": "asc" }]
}

### Excel export batch (repeat subsequent pages while hasNextPage is true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calculations/search
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": { "conditions": [{ "field": "suppliername", "operator": "contains", "value": "Bart" }] },
  "pagination": { "pageNumber": 1, "pageSize": 200 },
  "orderBy": [{ "field": "id", "direction": "desc" }]
}

### Invalid calculation number returns 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calculations/search
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": { "conditions": [{ "field": "id", "operator": "eq", "value": "abc" }] }
}

### Null filter entry returns 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calculations/search
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": { "conditions": [null] }
}